  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ayenajeyi Dutse Rice Production and Processing Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant for ADMCS, a local rice farming cooperative, will address identified issues such as low outputs, high wastage, and poor economic returns by providing funds for cooperative level management, financial, and organizational trainings as well as seed capital to establish a rice processing and milling facility.</narrative>
  </description>
